  m_Text: 'CONTROLS:

    - A / D or Left / Right Arrows: Move Ship

    - Space / Left Click: Fire Lasers

    - B / Right Click: Detonate EMP Nuke Bomb

    - Esc / P: Pause Match


    POWER-UPS:

    - Bolt: 3-Way Triple Shot (10s)

    - Shield: Absorbs 1 hit without losing lives

    - Star: Restores +1 Life Heart


    COMBOS & SCORING:

    - Defeat enemies within 2.2s to build Combo x2 to x5


    BOSS BATTLE:

    - Cross 80 points to summon the Giant Red UFO Mothership!'
